       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SDOCLST.
       AUTHOR.         W L MCINTYRE.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   JAN 1994.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS
      *D****************************************************************
      *D                      S  D  O  C  L  S  T                      *
      *D****************************************************************
      *D                                                               *
      *D   THIS INQUIRY PROGRAM ALLOWS THE SYSTEM ADMINISTRATOR TO     *
      *D   VIEW ALL FINAL FORMAT (FFTAS400/FFTDCA), RESOLVED, OV/400   *
      *D   DOCUMENTS IN THE DOCUMENTATION FOLDER.  THIS PROGRAM MUST   *
      *D   BE CALLED FROM EITHER A CL PROGRAM, OR A MAINLINE COBOL     *
      *D   PROGRAM, PASSING THE APPROPRIATE PARAMETERS: (DOCMNT FOUND  *
      *D   ERR.)  PLACING LOW-VALUES IN THE FOUND PARAMETER WHEN       *
      *D   CALLING THIS PROGRAM WILL CAUSE THE PICK-LIST OPTION TO BE  *
      *D   AVAILABLE FOR THE SYSTEM ADMINISTRATOR.  THE DOCUMENT       *
      *D   DETAILS FILE (MCFLDS0301) MUST BE UPDATED WITH CURRENT      *
      *D   INFORMATION FROM THE DOCUMENTATION FILE PRIOR TO EXECUTION  *
      *D   OF THIS PROGRAM.  THIS MUST BE HANDLED IN EITHER THE        *
      *D   CALLING CL PROGRAM OR THE MAINLINE COBOL PROGRAM.           *
      *D                                                               *
      *D****************************************************************
      *C****************************************************************
      *C   WL MCINTYRE     06-13-95
      *C   REVISE CODE TO RECOGNIZE ANY OF THE VALID FINAL-FORMAT
      *C   DOCUMENT TYPES FOR DOCUMENTS EXISTING IN THE CSIS/MMIS
      *C   ONLINE DOCUMENTATION SYSTEM FOLDER
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.

       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZDOCSYS-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MDOCDTL
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLDS0301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS MDOCDTL-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSPLY-REC                   PIC X(2000).

       FD  MDOCDTL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MOCDTL-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLDS0301.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    B U F F E R S
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(80).

       COPY MDOCDTL OF COPYLIB.

       01  WS-SCREEN.
           05  WS-ERRMSG               PIC X(79).
           05  DOCMTRECS OCCURS 10 TIMES.
               10  WS-NO               PIC X(02).
               10  WS-DOC              PIC X(10).
               10  WS-DES              PIC X(58).
           05  WS-CMDMSG               PIC X(74).
           05  WS-LNK                  PIC X(02).

       01  WS-LNKCHR                      PIC X(02) VALUE LOW-VALUES.
       01  WS-LNKNUM  REDEFINES WS-LNKCHR PIC 9(02).

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    C O P Y   M E M B E R    A R E A S
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY CATREAD OF COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.

       COPY WSCONTROL OF COPYLIB.

       COPY CPYIND OF COPYLIB.

       COPY IOFEEDBACK OF COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    D A T A B A S E   K E Y S  -   S T A T U S   F I E L D S
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  MDOCDTL-KEY.
           05  MDOCDTL-63               PIC X(63).
           05  MDOCDTL-12               PIC X(12).

       01  MDOCDTL-STATUS               PIC XX VALUE SPACES.
       01  DSPLY-STATUS                 PIC XX.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    D I S P L A Y   S C R E E N   D A T A   A R E A
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FZDOCSYS.
           COPY DD-ALL-FORMATS OF ZDOCSYS.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    L I T E R A L S
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FALS-VAL                    PIC 1 VALUE B"0".
       01  TRUE-VAL                    PIC 1 VALUE B"1".
       01  RESOLVED-LIT1               PIC X(08) VALUE "FFTAS400".
       01  RESOLVED-LIT2               PIC X(06) VALUE "FFTDCA".

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    P A G I N G   I N F O   A R E A
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  PAGE-NO                      PIC 9(02)  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  CURRENT-KEY.
           05  CK-63                    PIC X(63)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  CK-12                    PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
       01  NEXT-KEY.
           05  NK-63                    PIC X(63)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  NK-12                    PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    S A V E   A R E A S
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  SEL-COUNT                   PIC 99 COMP-3  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  SAVE-SEL-COUNT              PIC 99 COMP-3  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  INCREMENT-VALUE             PIC 99 COMP-3  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  SAVE-KEYS.
           05  SAVE-ENTRY          OCCURS 15 TIMES.
               10  SAVE-KEY        PIC X(75)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  SAVE-MDOCDTL.
           05 SAVE-MDOCDTL-RECORD OCCURS 10 TIMES PIC X(750).

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    S U B S C R I P T S
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  S1                          PIC 99 COMP-3  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  S2                          PIC 99 COMP-3  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  S3                          PIC 99 COMP-3  VALUE ZEROS.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    S W I T C H E S
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  SWITCHES.
           05  CONTINUE-SW             PIC X     VALUE "Y".
           05  FOUND-SW                PIC X     VALUE "N".
           05  INVALID-SW              PIC X     VALUE "N".
           05  ALL-SEL-EMPTY-SW        PIC X     VALUE "N".
           05  SEL-NOT-X-SW            PIC X     VALUE "N".
           05  LIST-RECS-SW            PIC X     VALUE " ".
           05  NEXT-PAGE-SW            PIC X     VALUE "N".
           05  PREV-PAGE-SW            PIC X     VALUE "N".

       01  CUR-DATE-WA.
           05  CUR-DATE-YY             PIC XX.
           05  C-D-YY-99 REDEFINES CUR-DATE-YY.
               10  CD-YEAR             PIC 99.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(4).

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    M I S C E L L A N E O U S
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-DATE.
           05  WS-CENT                 PIC 9(02).
           05  WS-YYMMDD               PIC 9(06).

       01  WS-FMT-DATE                 PIC 9999/99/99.
       01  WS-UNS-DOC                  PIC X(10).

       01  WS-SEQUENCE-WORK.
           05  WS-SEQUENCE-BIT OCCURS 2 TIMES PIC X(01).

       01  SCOPE                       PIC X(01).

       01  PASSWORD-INFORMATION.
           05  NAME-OF-PROGRAM     PIC X(08) VALUE "SDOCLST ".
           05  PROGRAM-TYPE        PIC X(02) VALUE "IN".
           05  PROGRAM-RELEASE     PIC X(12) VALUE " H0100010001".
           05  PROGRAM-DESCRIPTION.
               10  PROG-DESC-A     PIC X(60) VALUE
             "INQUIRY PROGRAM WHICH LISTS ALL FINAL FORMAT OV/400     ".
               10  PROG-DESC-B     PIC X(60) VALUE
             "DOCUMENTS FOR USE IN CSIS/MMIS ONLINE SYSTEM            ".
               10  PROG-FUNCTION   PIC X(60) VALUE SPACES.
           05  PASSWORD-FLAG       PIC X.

       01  ERROR-MESSAGE-TABLE.
           05  ERROR-VALUES.
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           " DOCUMENT NUMBER MUST BE A NUMBER LISTED ON SCREEN      ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           " MUST ENTER A NUMBER IN DOCUMENT NUMBER FIELD           ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           " CANNOT PAGE BACKWARD - AT TOP OF LIST                 ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           " CANNOT PAGE FORWARD - AT BOTTOM OF LIST                ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
               10  FILLER              PIC X(74)   VALUE
           "                                                        ".
           05  ERROR-MESSAGE   REDEFINES  ERROR-VALUES
               OCCURS 20  TIMES  PIC X(74).

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  DOCMNT                      PIC X(10).
       01  FOUND                       PIC X(01).
       01  ERR                         PIC X(01).

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    M A I N    P R O C E D U R E
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DOCMNT FOUND ERR.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN I-O   MDOCDTL.
       INIT-SEL-SCREEN.
           PERFORM 1-HOUSEKEEPING THRU 1-EXIT.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-EXIT.
           PERFORM 2-END-OF-JOB THRU 2-EXIT.

       1-HOUSEKEEPING.
           MOVE "C" TO SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING SCOPE.
           MOVE SPACES TO DOCMNT ERR.
           ACCEPT CUR-DATE-WA FROM DATE.
           IF CD-YEAR IS GREATER THAN 49
              MOVE 19 TO WS-CENT
           ELSE
              MOVE 20 TO WS-CENT.
           MOVE CUR-DATE-WA TO WS-YYMMDD.
           PERFORM 10-INIT-LIST THRU 10-EXIT.
      *----TURN ON IND TO ENABLE PICK/LIST FUNCTION ON SCREEN
           IF FOUND = LOW-VALUES
              MOVE SPACES TO FOUND
              MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (90).

       1-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       10-INIT-LIST.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-SCREEN FZDOCSYS.
           MOVE 0 TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES  TO NEXT-KEY MDOCDTL-KEY.
           MOVE MDOCDTL-KEY TO CURRENT-KEY.
           MOVE 1                    TO PAGE-NO.
           MOVE SPACES TO NEXT-PAGE-SW PREV-PAGE-SW.
           PERFORM 100-START-LIST     THRU 100-EXIT.

       10-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       100-START-LIST.
           MOVE MDOCDTL-KEY TO MOCDTL-REC.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO INDICS.
           MOVE SPACES      TO LIST-RECS-SW.
           START MDOCDTL
             KEY IS NOT LESS THAN FLRNAM OF MOCDTL-REC,
                                  DOCNAM OF MOCDTL-REC
             INVALID KEY
                 MOVE "N" TO LIST-RECS-SW.
           PERFORM 1000-INIT-VALUES THRU 1000-EXIT
               VARYING S1 FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL S1 > 10.
           MOVE 1 TO S1.
           IF LIST-RECS-SW NOT EQUAL TO  "N"
              PERFORM 1001-DOCUMENT-LIST THRU 1001-EXIT
                 UNTIL S1 > 11.
           MOVE WS-SCREEN TO FDOCLST-O.

       100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       1000-INIT-VALUES.
           MOVE SPACES TO DOCMTRECS (S1).

       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       1001-DOCUMENT-LIST.
           READ MDOCDTL NEXT RECORD
               INTO BUF-MDOCDTL
               WITH NO LOCK
               AT END
                 MOVE 12 TO S1
                 GO TO 1001-EXIT.
           IF S1 = 11
              IF DOCTYP OF MOCDTL-REC EQUAL RESOLVED-LIT1
                                      OR    RESOLVED-LIT2
      *----OVERFLOW FOR THIS SCREEN, SAVE KEY TO START NEXT PAGE IF
      *----RECORD IS FOR A FINAL FORMAT, RESOLVED DOCUMENT (RES-LIT)
                  MOVE "Y" TO NEXT-PAGE-SW
                  MOVE  FLRNAM OF MOCDTL-REC TO NK-63
                  MOVE  DOCNAM OF MOCDTL-REC TO NK-12
                  MOVE 12  TO S1
                  GO TO 1001-EXIT
              ELSE
                  GO TO 1001-DOCUMENT-LIST
              END-IF
           END-IF.
           IF DOCTYP OF MOCDTL-REC EQUAL RESOLVED-LIT1
                                   OR    RESOLVED-LIT2
      *----MOVE RESOLVED DOCUMENT DETAILS TO SCREEN
              MOVE S1                  TO  WS-NO   (S1)
      *----REMOVE ANY SUFFIXES TO DOCUMENT NAME
              PERFORM 10010-DELIMIT-DOC THRU 10010-EXIT
              MOVE DESC OF MOCDTL-REC  TO  WS-DES  (S1)
              MOVE MOCDTL-REC          TO SAVE-MDOCDTL-RECORD (S1)
      *----SAVE DATA FOR FIRST RECORD OF EACH SCREEN TO PAGE BACKWARD
              IF S1 = 1
                 MOVE MOCDTL-REC TO SAVE-KEY (PAGE-NO)
              END-IF
              ADD 1 TO S1
           END-IF.

       1001-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       10010-DELIMIT-DOC.
           UNSTRING DOCNAM OF MOCDTL-REC
             DELIMITED BY "."
             INTO WS-DOC (S1).

       10010-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       2-END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE MDOCDTL.
           GOBACK.

       2-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       5-PRINT-SCREEN.
             MOVE FZDOCSYS TO DSPLY-REC.
             PERFORM 99-SCREEN-WRITE THRU 99-EXIT.
             PERFORM 98-SCREEN-READ  THRU 98-EXIT.
             MOVE DSPLY-REC TO FZDOCSYS.

       5-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       6-MAIN.
           PERFORM 60-SET-PAGING-INDICATORS THRU 60-EXIT.
           MOVE "FDOCLST" TO VIEW-CFNAME.
           PERFORM 5-PRINT-SCREEN THRU 5-EXIT.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
              GO TO 6-EXIT
           ELSE IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR 7
              MOVE FALS-VAL TO INDS (99)
              PERFORM 61-PAGING-RQST THRU 61-EXIT
              GO TO 6-MAIN
           ELSE
              PERFORM 62-PROCESS-REQUEST THRU 62-EXIT
              IF CONTINUE-SW = "Y"
                 GO TO 6-MAIN
              END-IF
           END-IF
           END-IF.

       6-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       60-SET-PAGING-INDICATORS.
           IF NEXT-PAGE-SW = "Y"
              MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (19)
           ELSE
              MOVE FALS-VAL TO INDS (19).
           IF PREV-PAGE-SW = "Y"
              MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (20)
           ELSE
              MOVE FALS-VAL TO INDS (20).

       60-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       61-PAGING-RQST.
           IF (NEXT-PAGE-SW = "Y") AND (PREV-PAGE-SW = "Y")
              IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7
                 PERFORM 610-PAGE-FORWARD THRU 610-EXIT
                 GO TO 61-EXIT
              ELSE
                 MOVE SPACES TO NEXT-PAGE-SW
                 PERFORM 611-PAGE-BACKWARD THRU 611-EXIT
                 GO TO 61-EXIT
              END-IF
           END-IF.
           IF PREV-PAGE-SW = "Y"
              IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 6
                 PERFORM 611-PAGE-BACKWARD THRU 611-EXIT
                 GO TO 61-EXIT
              ELSE
                 MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (99)
                 MOVE ERROR-MESSAGE (04) TO ERRMSG OF FDOCLST-O
                 GO TO 61-EXIT
              END-IF
           END-IF.
           IF NEXT-PAGE-SW = "Y"
              IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7
                 MOVE "Y" TO PREV-PAGE-SW
                 PERFORM 610-PAGE-FORWARD THRU 610-EXIT
                 GO TO 61-EXIT
              ELSE
                 MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (99)
                 MOVE "N" TO INVALID-SW
                 MOVE ERROR-MESSAGE (03) TO ERRMSG OF FDOCLST-O
                 GO TO 61-EXIT
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       61-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       610-PAGE-FORWARD.
           ADD 1 TO PAGE-NO.
      *----USES THE SAVE KEY OF FIRST RECORD AFTER OVERFLOW
           MOVE NEXT-KEY TO MDOCDTL-KEY.
           MOVE SPACES TO NEXT-PAGE-SW.
           PERFORM 100-START-LIST THRU 100-EXIT.

       610-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       611-PAGE-BACKWARD.
           SUBTRACT 1 FROM PAGE-NO.
      *----USES THE SAVE KEY OF FIRST RECORD ON PRIOR SCREEN
           MOVE SAVE-KEY (PAGE-NO) TO MDOCDTL-KEY.
           IF PAGE-NO = 1
              MOVE SPACES TO PREV-PAGE-SW
           END-IF.
           PERFORM 100-START-LIST THRU 100-EXIT.

       611-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       62-PROCESS-REQUEST.
           MOVE FALS-VAL TO INDS (99).
           MOVE LNKDOCNO OF FDOCLST-I TO WS-LNKCHR.
           IF WS-LNKCHR EQUAL SPACES
              GO TO 62-EXIT.
           MOVE SPACES TO  WS-SEQUENCE-WORK.
           MOVE WS-LNKCHR TO WS-SEQUENCE-WORK.
           PERFORM 620-ADJUST-SEQUENCE THRU 620-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-SEQUENCE-WORK TO WS-LNKCHR.
           IF WS-LNKNUM NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (99)
              MOVE ERROR-MESSAGE (02) TO ERRMSG OF FDOCLST-O
              GO TO 62-EXIT.
           MOVE 1 TO S2.
      *----CHECK TO SEE THAT NUMBER IS A NUMBER LISTED ON SCREEN
           PERFORM 621-CHECK-DOCNO THRU 621-EXIT.
      *----IF A GOOD NUMBER, MOVE DOCUMENT NAME TO PARM AND EXIT LOGIC
           IF FOUND-SW = "Y"
              MOVE "N" TO CONTINUE-SW
              MOVE WS-DOC (WS-LNKNUM) TO DOCMNT
              GO TO 62-EXIT.
           MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (99).
           MOVE ERROR-MESSAGE (01) TO ERRMSG OF FDOCLST-O.

       62-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       620-ADJUST-SEQUENCE.
           IF  WS-SEQUENCE-BIT(1) NUMERIC
           AND WS-SEQUENCE-BIT(2) EQUAL SPACES
               MOVE WS-SEQUENCE-BIT(1) TO WS-SEQUENCE-BIT(2)
               MOVE ZERO               TO WS-SEQUENCE-BIT(1)
           END-IF.
           IF  WS-SEQUENCE-BIT(1) EQUAL SPACES
           AND WS-SEQUENCE-BIT(2) NUMERIC
               MOVE ZERO          TO WS-SEQUENCE-BIT(1)
           END-IF.

       620-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       621-CHECK-DOCNO.
           IF S2 > 10
              GO TO 621-EXIT.
           IF WS-NO (S2) = WS-LNKNUM
              MOVE "Y" TO FOUND-SW
              GO TO 621-EXIT
           ELSE
              ADD 1 TO S2
              GO TO 621-CHECK-DOCNO.

       621-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       98-SCREEN-READ.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-CFNAME
               INDICATORS ARE INDICS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           IF DSPLY-STATUS NOT = "00"
             MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
             MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.

       98-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       98A-SCREEN-READ.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE TERMINAL IS TERMINAL-ID
               INDICATORS ARE INDICS
                   NO DATA MOVE DSPLY-STATUS TO DSPLY-STATUS.

       98A-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       99-SCREEN-WRITE.
           WRITE DSPLY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-CFNAME
               INDICATORS ARE INDICS.

       99-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       999-CATREAD.
           MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
